{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_1","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"◎地理下","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_2","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"○大名府路河东北路河东南路京兆府路凤翔路鄜延路庆原路临洮路","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_3","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"大名府路，宋北京魏郡。府一，领刺郡三，县二十，镇二十二。贞祐二年十月置行尚书省。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_4","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"大名府，上，天雄军。旧为散府，先置统军司，天德二年罢，以其所辖民户分隶旁近总管府。正隆二年升为总管府，附近十二猛安皆隶焉，兼漕河事。(产皱、谷、绢、梨肉、樱桃、煎木耳、硝。)户三十万八千五百一十一。县十、镇十三：(旧有柳林、侯固二镇。)","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_5","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"元城(有惬山、漕运御河、屯氏河。)镇二(安定、安贤。)","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_6","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"大名(倚。)镇一","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_7","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"魏县","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_8","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"冠氏(有弇山、水沙河。)镇四(普通、清水、博宁、桑桥。)","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_9","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"南乐镇一(南乐。)","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_10","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"馆陶(有漕运御河。)镇一(馆陶。)","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_11","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"夏津(有屯氏河、润沟河。)镇一(孙生。)","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_12","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"朝城镇一(韩张。)","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_13","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"清平(有新渠金堤。)镇一(清平。)","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_14","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"莘镇一(马桥。)","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_15","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"恩州，中，刺史。宋清河郡军事，治清河，今治历亭。户九万九千一百一十九。县四、镇六：","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_16","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"历亭(倚。有永济渠，置河仓。)镇四(漳南、新安乐、旧安乐、王杲。)","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_17","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"武城(有永济渠、沙河。)镇一(武城。)","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_18","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"清河(有永济渠、漳渠。)","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_19","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临清(有河仓。)镇一(曹仁。)","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_20","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"濮州，下，刺史。宋濮阳郡。户五万二千九百四十八。县二、镇三：","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_21","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"鄄城(倚。有旄丘、陶丘、金堤。)镇二(临濮、雷泽、皆旧县、贞元二年为镇。)","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_22","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"范　镇一(定安。)","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_23","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"开州，中，刺史。宋开德府澶渊郡镇宁军节度，降为澶州，皇统四年复更今名。户三万三千八百三十六。县四、镇一：","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_24","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"濮阳(倚。有卫阳山、鲋鳎山、黄河、淇河、瓠子口。)","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_25","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"清丰(有广阳山、黄河。)","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_26","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"观城(有泉源河。)镇一(武乡。)","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_27","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"长垣(本隶南京，泰和八年以限河不便。来属。)","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_28","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河东北路。宋河东路，天会六年析河东为南、北路，各置兵马都总管。府一，领节镇三，刺郡九，县三十九，镇四十，堡十，寨八。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_29","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"太原府，上，武勇军。宋太原郡河东军节度，国初依旧为次府，复名并州太原郡河东军总管府，置转运司。(有造墨场，炼银洞、玛瑙石。药产松脂、白胶香、五灵脂。大黄、白玉石。)户一十六万五千八百六十二。县十一、镇八：","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_30","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"阳曲(倚。有罕山、蒙山、汾水。)镇五(阳曲、百井、赤塘关、天门关、陵井驿。)","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_31","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"太谷(有太谷山、蒋水。)","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_32","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平晋(贞祐四年七月废，兴定元年复置。有龙山、晋水。)镇二(晋宁、晋祠。)","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_33","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"清源(有清源水、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_34","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"徐沟(本清源县之徐沟镇，大定二十九年升。)","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_35","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"榆次(有麓台山、涂水。)","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_36","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"祁(有帻山、太谷水)镇一(团柏。)","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_37","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"文水(有隐泉山、汾水、文水。)","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_38","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"交城(有少杨山、狐突山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_39","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"盂(兴定中升为州，听绛州元帅府节制，置刺史，寻复。有白马山、原仇山、滹沱水。)","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_40","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"寿阳(兴定二年九月尝割隶平定州，有方山、洞过水。)","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_41","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"晋州。(兴定四年正月以寿阳县西张寨置。)","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_42","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"忻州，下，刺史。旧定襄郡军。户三万二千三百四十一。县二、镇四：","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_43","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"秀容(有程候山、云母山、忻水、滹沱水。)镇四(忻口、云内、徒合、石岭。)","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_44","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"定襄","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_45","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平定州，中，刺史。本宋平定军，大定二年升为州。兴定二年为防御，十一月复降为刺郡。户一万八千二百九十六。县二、镇三：","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_46","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平定(倚。有浮山、浮泺水。)镇二(承天、东百井。)","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_47","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"乐平(兴定四年正月升为皋州。有乐平山、清漳水。)镇一(净阳。)","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_48","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"汾州，上。宋西河郡军事，天会六年置汾阳军节度使，后又置河东、南、北路提刑司。户八万七千一百二十七。县五、镇二：","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_49","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"西河(有谒泉山、比干山、文水、汾水。)镇一(郭栅。)","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_50","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"孝义(有胜水。)","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_51","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"介休(有介山、汾水。)镇一(洪山。)","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_52","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平遥(有鹿台山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_53","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"灵石(贞祐三年割霍州，四年五月后来属。有静岩山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_54","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"石州，上，刺史。旧昌化军。兴定五年复隶晋阳，从郭振之请也。户三万六千五百二十八。县六、镇四：","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_55","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"离石(倚。有胡公山、离石水。)镇一(石窟。)","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_56","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"方山(贞祐四年徙治于积翠山。有方山、赤洪水。)","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_57","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"孟门(旧名定胡，明昌六年更。宋隶晋宁军。有黄河、宁乡水。)镇二(吴保、天泽。)","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_58","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"温泉(贞祐四年五月改隶汾州。有远望山、温泉。)","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_59","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临泉(宋隶晋宁军。有黄河、临泉水。)镇一(克胡。)","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_60","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宁乡(旧名平夷，明昌六年更。)","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_61","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"葭州，下，刺史。本晋宁军，贞元元年隶汾州，大定二十二年升为晋宁州，二十四年更今名。在黄河西，兴定二年五月以河东残破，改隶延安府。户八千八百六十四。寨八、堡九：(神泉寨、永祚堡、乌龙寨、康定堡、宁河寨、宁河堡、太和寨、神木寨、通津堡、弥川寨、护川堡、强川堡、清川堡、通秦寨、通秦堡、晋安堡、吴堡寨。已上皆在黄河西，临西夏界。)","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_62","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"代州，中。宋雁门郡防御，天会六年置震武军节度使。贞祐二年四月侨置西经略司，八月罢。户五万七千六百九十。县五、镇十三：","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_63","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"雁门(倚。有夏屋山、雁门山、滹沱水。)镇三(雁门、西陉、胡谷。)","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_64","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"崞(倚。有崞山、石鼓山、滹沱河、沙河。)镇一(楼板。)","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_65","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"五台(贞祐四年三月升为台州。有五台山、蠙虑水。)镇二(兴善、石觜。)","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_66","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"广武(贞祐三年七月来属。)","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_67","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"繁畤(贞祐三年九月升为坚州。)镇七(茹越、大石、义兴、麻谷、瓶形、梅乃、宝兴。)","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_68","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"庾州，下。中宋旧火山军，大定二十二年升为火山州，后更今名。兴定二年九月改隶岚州，四年以残破徙治于黄河滩许父寨。户七千五百九十二。县一、镇一：","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_69","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河曲(贞元元年置。有火山、黄河。)镇一(邺镇。)","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_70","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宁化州，下，刺史。本宁化军，大定二十二年升为州。户六千一百。县一、镇一","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_71","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宁化镇一(窟谷。)","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_72","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"岚州，下，宋旧楼烦郡军事，天会六年置镇西节度使。户一万七千五百五十七。县三、镇四：","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_73","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宜芳镇一(飞鸢。)","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_74","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"合河镇三(合河津、乳浪、盐院渡。)","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_75","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"楼烦","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_76","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"岢岚州，下，刺史。本宋岢岚军，大定二十二年为州，贞祐三年九月升为防御，四年正月升为节镇，五月复防御。户五千八百五十一。县一、堡一：","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_77","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"岚谷(有岢岚山、雪山、岢岚水。)堡一(寒光。)","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_78","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"保德州，下，刺史。本宋保德军，大定二十二年升为州，元光元年六月升为防御。户三千一百九十一。县一：","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_79","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"保德(大定十一年置。有大堡津、沙谷津。)","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_80","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"管州，下，刺史。本宋宪州静乐郡，天德三年更。兴定三年升为防御。户五千八百八十一。县一：","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_81","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"静乐","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_82","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河东南路，府二，领节镇三，防御一，刺郡六，县六十八，镇二十九，关六。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_83","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平阳府，上。宋平阳郡建雄军节度。本晋州，初为次府，置建雄军节度使。天会六年升总管府。置转运司。兴定二年十二月以残破降为散府。(有书籍。产解盐、隰州绿、卷子布、龙门椒、紫团参、甘草、苍术。户一十三万六千九百三十六。县十、镇一：)","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_84","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临汾(天会六年定临汾为次赤，余并次畿，置丞、簿、尉各一。有姑射山、平水、壶口山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_85","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"襄陵(倚。有浮山、汾水、橘水。)镇一(故关。)","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_86","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"洪洞(有霍山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_87","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"赵城(有姑射山、汾水、霍水。)","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_88","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"霍邑(贞祐三年七月升为霍州，以赵城、汾西、灵石隶焉。兴定元年七月升为节镇，军曰镇定。有霍山、汾水、彘水。)","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_89","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"汾西(有汾西山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_90","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"岳阳(有乌岭山、通军水。)","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_91","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"浮山(旧名神山，大定七年更为浮山，兴定四年更名曰忠孝。)","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_92","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"和川","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_93","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"冀氏","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_94","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"隰州，上，刺史。宋大宁郡。团练。旧大宁郡军刺史，天会六年改为南隰州，以与北京隰州重也，天德三年去“南”字。户二万五千四百四十五。县六、关四：","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_95","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"隰川(倚。有石马山、石楼山。)","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_96","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"仵城(兴定五年正月升为隰川之午城镇置。)","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_97","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"蒲(兴定五年正月升为蒲州，以大宁隶焉。有孤石山、横木岭。)","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_98","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"大宁(有孔山、黄河、日斤水。)关一(马门关。)","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_99","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"永和(有楼山、黄河、仙芝水。)关一(永和关。)","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_100","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"石楼(有石楼山、黄河、龙泉。)关二(永宁、上平关。)","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_101","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"吉州，下，刺史。宋置团练。旧名慈州，天德三年改为耿州，置文成郡军，明昌元年更名吉。户一万三千三百二十四。县二：","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_102","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"吉乡(有壶口山、孟门山、黄河、蒲水。)","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_103","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"乡宁","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_104","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河中府，散，上。宋河东郡。旧置护国军节度使，天会六年降为蒲州，置防御使。天德元年升为河中府，仍旧护国军节度使。大定五年置陕西元帅府。户十万六千五百三十九。县七、镇四：","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_105","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河东(倚。有中条山、五老山、黄河、妫水、汭水。)镇二(永乐、合河。)","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_106","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"荥河(贞祐三年升为荥州，以河津、万泉隶焉。有黄河、汾水。睢丘。)镇一(北郎。)","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_107","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"虞乡(有雷首山、中条山、坛道山。)","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_108","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"万泉镇一(胡壁。)","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_109","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临晋(有三疑山、黄河。)","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_110","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河津","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_111","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"猗氏(有涑水。)","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_112","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"绛州，上。宋置绛郡防御。天会六年绛阳军节度使。兴定二年十二月升为晋安府，总管河东南路兵马，三年三月置河东南路转运司。户一十三万一千五百一十。县七、镇五、关一：","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_113","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"正平(倚。剧。有定境山、汾水、澮水、鼓水。)镇一(泽掌。)","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_114","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"曲沃(剧。有绛山、绛水、汾水、澮水。)镇二(柴村、九王。)","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_115","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"稷山(有稷山、汾水。)","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_116","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"翼城(兴定四年七月升为翼州，以垣曲、绛县隶焉。元光二年升为节镇，军曰翼安。有澮高山、清野山、乌岭山。)","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_117","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"太平(有汾水。)","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_118","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"垣曲(有王屋山、清廉山、黄河、清山。)镇一(皋落。)关一(行台。)","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_119","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"绛(有太阴山、教山、绛水。)镇一(绘交。)","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_120","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平水(兴定四年七月徙置汾河之西，从平阳公胡天作之请也。)","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_121","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"解州，上，刺史。宋庆成军防御，国初置解梁郡军，后废为刺郡。贞祐三年复升为节镇，军名宝昌。兴定四年徙治平陆县。户七万一千二百三十二。县六、镇四：","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_122","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"解(倚。有坛道山、盐池。)","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_123","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平陆(有吴山、黄河。)镇一(张店。)","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_124","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"芮城(宋隶陕州。有中条山、黄河、龙泉。)","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_125","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"夏(有巫咸山、中条山、淡水。)镇一(曹张。)","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_126","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"安邑(有中条山、稷山、盐池、涑水。)","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_127","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"闻喜(有九龙山、汤山、涑水。)镇二(东镇、刘庄。)","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_128","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"泽州，上，刺史。宋高平郡。天会六年以北京泽州同，加“南”字。天德三年复去“南”字。贞祐四年隶潞州昭义军，后又改隶孟州。元光二年升为节镇，军曰忠昌。户五万九升四百一十六。县六、镇二：","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_129","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"晋城(倚。有太行山、丹水、白水、天井关。)镇二(周村、巴公。旧又置星轺镇。)","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_130","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"端氏(有石门山、巨峻山。)","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_131","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"陵川(有太行山、九仙山。)","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_132","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"阳城(元光二年十一月升为绩州。有王屋山、濩泽。)","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_133","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"高平(有头颅山、米山、丹水。)","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_134","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"沁水(有鹿台山、沁水、马邑山。)","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_135","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"潞州，上。宋隆德府上党郡昭德军节度使。天会六年，节度使兼潞南沁观察处置使。户七九千二百三十二。县八、镇四：","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_136","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"上党(倚。)镇一(八义。)","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_137","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"壶关(有抱犊山、紫团山、赤壤山。)","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_138","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"屯留(有盘秀山、绛水。)镇一(寺底。)","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_139","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"长子(有羊头山、发鸠山、尧水)镇一(横水。)","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_140","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"潞城(有三垂山、伏牛山、潞水、漳水。)","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_141","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"襄垣(有鹿台山、涅水、漳水。)镇一(礻虎亭。)","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_142","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"黎城(有白岩山、故壶口关。)","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_143","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"涉(贞祐三年七月升为崇州，以黎城县隶焉。四年八月以残破复为县。兴定五年九月复升为州。有崇山、涉水。)","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_144","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"辽州，中，刺史。宋本乐平郡刺史，天会六年以与东京辽州同，加“南”字，天德三年复去“南”字。户一万五千八百五十。县四、镇一、关一：","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_145","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"辽山(倚。有箕山、青谷水。)镇一(平城、旧县也、贞元间废为镇，属辽山县，及废旧芹泉镇。)关一(黄泽。)","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_146","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"榆社(有武乡水、石勒沤麻池。)","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_147","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"和顺(有九原山。)","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_148","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"仪城(旧为平城县，贞元二年废入辽山为镇，贞祐四年复升为县，更今名。)","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_149","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"沁州，中，刺史锦山郡。宋威胜军，天会六年升为州。元光二年升为节镇，军曰义胜。户一万八千五十九。县四、镇一：","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_150","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"铜鞮(倚。有铜鞮山、石梯山、洹水、交水。)","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_151","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"武乡(有胡甲山、武乡水。)镇一(南关。)","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_152","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"沁原(元光二年十一月升为谷州。有霍山、沁水。)","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_153","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"绵上(有羊头山、沁水。)","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_154","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"怀州，上，宋河内郡防御，天会六年以与临潢府怀州同、加“南”字，仍旧置沁南军节度使，天德三年去“南”字。皇统三年闰四月置黄沁河堤都大管勾司。大定五年置行元帅府。兴定五年置招抚司。户八万六千七百五十六。县四、镇六：","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_155","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河内(倚。有太行陉、太行山、黄河、沁水、浿水。)镇四(武德、柏乡、万善、清化。)","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_156","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"修武(有浊鹿城。)镇一(承恩。)","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_157","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"山阳(兴定四年以修武县重泉村为山阳县，隶辉州。)","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_158","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"武陟(有太行山、天门山、黄河、沁水。)镇一(宋郭。)","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_159","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"孟州，上。宋济源郡节度，天会六年降河阳府为孟州，置防御，守盟津。宣宗朝置经略司。户四万一千六百四十九。县四、镇二：","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_160","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河阳(倚。有岭山、黄河、湛水、同水。)镇二(谷罗、沇河。)","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_161","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"王屋(有王屋山、天坛山、析城山、黄河。)","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_162","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"济源(有太行山、孔山、济水、澳水、沁水。)","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_163","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"温(有黄河、湋水。)","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_164","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"京兆府路，宋为永兴军路。皇统二年省并陕西六路为四，曰京兆，曰庆原，曰熙秦，曰鄜延。府一，领节镇一，防御一，刺郡四，县三十六、镇三十七。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_165","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"京兆府，上。宋京兆郡永兴军节度使。皇统二年置总管府，天德二置陕西路统军司、陕西东路转运司。(产白芷、麻黄、白蒺藜、茴香、细辛。)户九万八千一百七十七。县十二、镇十：(旧又有中桥、临泾二镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_166","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"长安(倚。有终南山、龙首山、沣水、渭水、镐水。)镇一(子午。)","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_167","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"咸宁(倚。本万年，后更名。泰和四年废，寻复。)镇二(鸣犊、乾祐。)","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_168","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"兴平(有渭水、醴泉。)","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_169","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"泾阳","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_170","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临潼(有骊山、渭水、戏水。)镇一(零口。)","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_171","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"蓝田(有蓝田山、匮山、灞水。)","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_172","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"云阳　镇一(孟店。)","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_173","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"高陵(有泾水、渭水、白渠)镇二(毗沙、渭城。)","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_174","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"终南(宋清平军。)镇一(甘河。)","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_175","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"栎阳(有渭水、沮河、清泉陂。)镇一(粟邑。)","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_176","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"鄠(有终南山、牛首山、氵美陂、渭水。)镇一(秦渡。)","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_177","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"咸阳","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_178","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"商州，下，刺史。宋上洛郡军事。贞祐四年升为防御，寻隶陕州，兴定二年正月复来属，元光二年五月改隶河南路。户三千九百九十九。县二、镇一：(旧又有西市、黄川、青云三镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_179","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"上洛(有楚山、熊耳山、丹水、峣关。)镇二(商洛、丰阳，皆旧为县，贞元二年废为镇。)","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_180","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"洛南(有冢岭山、洛水。)","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_181","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"虢州，下，刺史。宋虢郡军事。贞祐二年割为陕州支郡，以备潼关。户一万二十二。县三、镇五：","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_182","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"虢略(有鹿蹄山、黄河。烛水。)镇三(靖远、玉城、朱阳。)","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_183","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"卢氏(有朱阳山、熊耳山、洛水、鄢水。)镇二(社管，栾川旧为县，海陵贞元二年废为镇。)","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_184","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"朱阳(海陵时当废，后复置。有地肺山。)","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_185","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"乾州，中，刺史。宋尝改为醴州，天德三年复。户二万六千八百五十六。县四、镇三：","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_186","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"奉天(有梁山、莫谷水、甘谷水。)镇一(薛禄。)","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_187","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"醴泉(有九峻山、浪水。)镇一(甘北。)","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_188","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"武亭(本武功，大定二十九年以嫌显宗讳更。有敦物山、武功山、渭水。)镇一(长宁。)","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_189","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"好畤(有梁山、武亭河。)","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_190","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"同州，中，宋冯翊郡定国节度，治冯翊。后改安国军节度使。(旧贡圆筋茧耳羊，大定十一年罢之。)户三万五千五百六十一。县六、镇九：","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_191","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"冯翊(倚。有洛水、渭水。)镇二(沙苑并临。)","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_192","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"朝邑(有黄河、渭水。)镇四(朝邑、新市、延祥、洿谷。)","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_193","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"白水(有五龙山、洛水、白水。)","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_194","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"郃阳(有非山、瀵水、黄河。)镇一(夏阳。)","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_195","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"澄城(有梁山、洛水。)","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_196","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"韩城(贞祐三年为桢州，以郃阳县隶焉。)镇二(寺前、良辅。)","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_197","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"耀州，上，刺史。宋华原郡感德军节度，皇统二年降为军事，后为刺史州。户五万二百一十一。县四、镇二：","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_198","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"华原(有土门山、漆水、沮水。)","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_199","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"同官(有白马山、同官川。)镇一(黄堡。)","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_200","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"美原(有频阳山。)","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_201","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"三原(有尧门山、中白渠。)镇一(龙桥。)","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_202","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"华州，中。宋华阴郡镇潼军节度，治郑，国初因之，后置节度使，皇统二年降为防御使。贞祐三年八月升为节镇，军曰金安，以商州为支郡。户五万三千八百。县五、镇六：","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_203","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"郑(倚。有少华山、圣山、渭水、符禺水。)镇一(赤水。)","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_204","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"华阴(有太华山、松果山、黄河、渭水、潼关。)镇二(关西、敷水。)","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_205","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"下邽(有渭水、太白渠。)镇二(素化、新市。)","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_206","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"蒲城(有金粟山、洛水。)镇一(荆姚。)","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_207","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"渭南(有灵台山、渭水。)","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_208","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"凤翔路，宋秦凤路，治秦州。府二、领防御二，刺郡二，县三十三，城一，堡四，寨十四，镇十五。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_209","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"凤翔府，中。宋扶风郡凤翔军节度。皇统二年升为府，军名天兴，大定十九年更军名为凤翔。大定二十七年升总管府。(产芎藭、独活、灯草、无心草、升麻、秦艽、骨碎补、羌活。)户六万三千三百三。县九、镇四：(旧有横水、驿店、崔模、麻务，长清五镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_210","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"凤翔(倚。有杜阳山、吴岳、雍水。旧名天兴县，大定十九年更。)","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_211","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宝鸡(有陈仓山、渭水、氵幵水、大散关。)镇一(武城。)","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_212","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"虢(有楚山、渭水。)镇一(阳平。)","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_213","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"郿(有太白山、渭水。)","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_214","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"盭厔(南至巡马道二十里。贞祐四年升为恒州，以郿县隶焉。有终南山、渭水、浴谷。)","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_215","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"扶风(国初作扶兴。有渭水、湋水。)镇一(岐阳。)","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_216","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"岐山(有岐山、终南山、渭水、姜水、氵幵水。)镇一(马迹。)","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_217","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"普润(有杜水、漆水、岐山。)","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_218","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"麟游(有五将山、黝土山。)","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_219","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"德顺州，上，刺史。宋德顺军，国初隶熙秦路，皇统二年升为州，大定二十七年来属。贞祐四年四月升为防御，十月升为节镇，军曰陇安。户三万五千四百四十九。县六、寨四、堡一：(旧有上接镇、通安寨、王家城、牧龙城、同家堡、后废。)","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_220","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"陇干(倚。)","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_221","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"水洛(本中安堡城。)堡一(中安。)","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_222","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"威戎(本威戎堡城。)","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_223","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"隆德(本隆德寨。)","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_224","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"通边(本通边寨。)寨三(静边旧为县，得胜，宁安。)","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_225","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"治平(本治平寨。)寨一(怀远。)","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_226","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平凉府，散，中。宋渭州陇西郡平凉军节度。旧为军，后置陕西西路转运司、陕西东、西路提刑司。大定二十六年来属。户三万一千三十三。县五、镇五、寨一：","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_227","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"平凉(倚。有羊头山、马屯山。)","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_228","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"潘原(有鸟鼠山、铜城山。)","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_229","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"崇信(有阁川水。)镇一(西赤城。)","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_230","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"华亭(有小陇山。)","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_231","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"化平(本名安化，大定七年更。)镇四(安化、安国、白岩河、耀武。)寨一(瓦亭。)","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_232","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"镇戎州，下，刺史。本镇戎军，大定二十二年为州，二十七年来属。户一万四百四十七。县二、堡三、寨八：","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_233","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"东山(本东山寨。)","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_234","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"三川(本三川寨。)堡三(彭阳、乾兴、开远。)寨八(天圣、飞泉、熙宁、灵平、通峡、荡羌、九羊、张义。)","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_235","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"秦州，下。宋天水郡雄武军节度，后置秦凤路。国初置节度，皇统二年置防御使，隶熙秦路，大定二十七年来属，元光二年四月升为节镇，军曰镇远，后罢，贞祐三年复置。户四万四百四十八。县八、城一、寨三、镇二：(旧有甘谷城、甘泉城、结藏城、定西寨、西顾堡，后废。)","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_236","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"成纪(倚。有龙马泉。)","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_237","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"冶坊","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_238","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"甘谷","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_239","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"清水(宋旧县。有中陇山、嶓冢山、清水。)","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_240","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"鸡川","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_241","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"陇城(有大陇山、瓦亭山。)寨一(陇城。)","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_242","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"西宁(贞祐四年十月升为西宁州，以甘谷、鸡川、治平三县隶焉。)","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_243","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"秦安　城一(伏羌。)寨二(三阳务、弓门。)镇二(静戎、褷穰。)","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_244","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"陇州，下，宋氵幵阳郡，防御。海陵时隶熙秦路，大定二十七年来属。户一万六千四百四十二。县三、镇五：","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_245","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"氵幵阳倚。有氵幵水、隃麋泽。)镇二(安化、新兴。)","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_246","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"氵幵源(有吴岩山、白环水。)镇三(吴山、定戎、陇西。)","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_247","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"陇安(泰和八年以陇安寨升。有秦岭山、渭水。)","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_248","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"鄜延路，府一，领节镇一，刺郡四，县十六，镇五，城二，堡四，寨十八，关二。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_249","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"延安府，下。宋延安郡彰武军节度使，皇统二年置彰武军总管府。户八万中九百九十四。县七、寨四、堡一、镇一。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_250","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"肤施(倚。有五龙山、伏龙山、洛水、清水、濯巾水。)镇一(乐盘。)","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_251","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"延川(有濯巾水、黄河、吐延水。)寨一(永平。)","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_252","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"延长(有独战山、濯巾水。)","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_253","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临真(有库利川。)","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_254","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"甘泉(有洛水。)","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_255","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"敷政(有三捶山、洛水。)","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_256","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"门山(有重覆山、黄河、渭牙川水。)堡二(安定，置第六正将。安寨。)寨四(万安，兴定二年废。德安，置第五副将。招安。永平，有丹阳驿。)","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_257","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"丹州，中，刺史。宋咸宁郡军事，国初因之。户一万三千七十八。县一、镇一、关一：","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_258","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宜川(有云岩山、孟门山、黄河、库利川。)镇一(云岩。)关一(乌仁。)","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_259","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"保安州，下，刺史。宋保安军，大定二十二年升为州。户七千三百四十。县一、寨三、镇二、堡一、城一：","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_260","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"保安(大定十二年以保安军置。)寨三(德靖、顺宁、平戎。)镇二(静边、永和。)堡一(园林。)城一(金汤。)","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_261","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"绥德州，下，刺史。唐绥州，宋绥德军，大定二十二年升为州。户一万二千七百二十。县一、寨十、城一、堡一、关一","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_262","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"清涧(本宋清涧城，大定二十二年升。)寨十(暖泉，义合，清边，临夏，白草，米脂置第二将，怀宁，镇边，绥平，克戎置第四将。)城一嗣武。)堡一(开光。)关一(永宁。)","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_263","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"鄜州，下。宋洛交郡康定军节度，国初因之，置保大军节度使。户六万二千九百三十一。县四、镇一：","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_264","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"洛交(倚。有疏属山、洛水、华池水。)镇一(三川。)","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_265","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"直罗(有大盘山、罗川水。)","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_266","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"郦城(有杨班湫。)","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_267","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"洛川(有洛川水、圜水。)","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_268","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"坊州，中，刺史。宋中部郡军事。户二万七百四十六。县二、镇一：","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_269","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"中部(有沮河、桥山、石堂山、洛水、蒲谷水。)","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_270","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宜君(有沮水。)镇一(玉华。)","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_271","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"天会五年，元帅府宗翰、宗望奉诏伐宋，若克宋则割地以赐夏。及宋既克，乃分割楚、夏疆封，自麟府路洛阳沟距黄河西岸，西历暖泉堡，鄜延路米脂谷至累胜寨，环庆路威边寨逾九星原至委布谷，泾原路威川寨略古萧关至北谷，秦凤路通怀堡至古会州，自此距黄河，依见流分熙河路尽西边，以限楚、夏之封，或指定地名有悬邈者，相地势从便分画。","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_272","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"庆原路，旧作陕西西路。府一，领节镇二，刺郡三，县十八，镇二十三，城二，堡四，寨二十二，边将营八。","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_273","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"庆阳府，中。宋安化郡庆阳军节度。本庆州军事，国初改安国军，后置定安军节度使兼总管，皇统二年置总管府。户四万六千一百七十一。县三、城二、堡一、寨三、镇七：","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_274","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"安化(倚。有马岭山、延庆水。)","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_275","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"彭原(有彭池原、睦阳川。)镇二(董志、赤城。)","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_276","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"合水(有子午山。)镇五(金柜、怀安、业乐、五交、景山。)城二(白豹、大顺。)寨三(安疆、华池、柔远。)堡一(荔原。)","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_277","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"环州，上，刺史。宋军事，国初因之，大定间升为刺郡。户九千五百四。县一、堡三、寨六、镇三：","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_278","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"通远(倚。有卤河、马岭坂、塔子平榷场。)堡三(木瓜、归德、兴平。旧有惠丁、射香、流井三堡，后废。)寨六(定边、平远、永和、洪德、乌伦、安边。)镇三(合道、马岭、木波。)","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_279","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宁州，中，刺史。宋彭原郡兴宁军节度，国初因之，皇统二年降为军，仍加“西”字，天德二年去“西”字，为刺郡。户三万四千七百五十七。县四、镇五：","sentenceOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_280","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"安定(本名定安，大定七年更。倚。有洛水、九陵水。)镇一(交城。)","sentenceOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_281","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"定平镇二(枣社、大昌。)","sentenceOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_282","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"真宁(有子午山、罗川水。)镇二(要关、山河。)","sentenceOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_283","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"襄乐(有延川水。)","sentenceOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_284","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"邠州，中。宋新平郡静难军节度使，国初因之。户四万七千二百九十一。县五、镇三、寨一：","sentenceOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_285","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"新平(倚。有泾水、潘水。)","sentenceOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_286","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"淳化(有仲山、车箱坂。)","sentenceOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_287","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宜禄(有泾水、汭水。)镇一(亭口。)","sentenceOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_288","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"永寿(宋隶醴州。有高泉山。)镇一(永寿。旧有邵寨镇，后割隶泾州。)寨一(常宁。)","sentenceOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_289","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"三水(有石门山、泾水、罗川水。)镇一(清泉。)","sentenceOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_290","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"原州，上，刺史。宋平凉郡军事，大定二十七年为泾州支郡，后复军事。户一万七千八百。县二、镇三、寨五：","sentenceOrder":290},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_291","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临泾(倚。有阳晋水、朝那水。)","sentenceOrder":291},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_292","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"彭阳(有大湖河、蒲川河。)镇三(萧镇、柳泉、新城。)寨五(绥宁、平宁、靖安、开边、西壕。)","sentenceOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_293","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"泾州，中，彰化军节度使。本治泾川，元光二年徙治长武。户二万六千二百九十。县四、寨一、镇二：","sentenceOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_294","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"泾川(本保定县，大定七年更。)寨一(官地。)","sentenceOrder":294},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_295","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"长武","sentenceOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_296","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"良原","sentenceOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_297","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"灵台镇二(百里、邵寨。)","sentenceOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_298","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"边将：","sentenceOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_299","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"第二将营，在荔原堡西，白豹城南七十五里，户三千七百一十六。","sentenceOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_300","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第四将营，户一千二百三十二。","sentenceOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_301","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第三将营，户二千一百五。","sentenceOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_302","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第八将营，户一千二百二十二。","sentenceOrder":302},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_303","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第七将营，户八百五十。","sentenceOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_304","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第九将营，户七百二十七。","sentenceOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_305","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第六将营，户九百八十九。","sentenceOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_306","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"次西第五将营，户三百六十四。","sentenceOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_307","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"皇统六年，以德威城、西安州、定边军等沿边地赐夏国，从所请也。正隆元年，命与夏国边界对立烽候，以防侵轶。","sentenceOrder":307},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_308","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临洮路，皇统二年改熙州为临洮府，置熙秦路总管府，大定二十七年更今名。府一，领节镇一，防御一，刺郡四，县一十三，镇六，城六，堡十二，寨九，关二。","sentenceOrder":308},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_309","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"临洮府，中。宋旧熙州临洮郡镇洮军节度，后更为德顺军，皇统二年置总管府。(产甘草、庵珣子、大黄。)户一万九升七百二十一。县三、镇一、城一、堡四：","sentenceOrder":309},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_310","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"狄道(有白石山、洮水、浩亹河。)镇一(庆平。)城一(景骨。)","sentenceOrder":310},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_311","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"当川堡一(通谷。)","sentenceOrder":311},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_312","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"康乐堡三(渭源，临洮，南川临宋界。)","sentenceOrder":312},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_313","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"积石州，下，刺史。本宋积石这溪哥城，大定二十二年为州，户五千一百八十五。县一、城三、堡三：","sentenceOrder":313},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_314","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"怀羌(西至生羌界八十里。)城三(循化，西至生羌界一百里。大通，临河、夏界。来羌，临夏边。)堡三(通津、临滩、来同。)","sentenceOrder":314},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_315","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"洮州，下。宋尝置团练。刺史。旧军事。临宋界，至西生羌界八十里。户一万一千三百三十七。堡二：(通祐，临宋界，无民户，置军守。铁城，临宋界，无民户，置军守。)","sentenceOrder":315},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_316","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"兰州，上，刺史。宋金城郡军事。户一万一千三百六十、镇三、城二、堡三、关一：","sentenceOrder":316},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_317","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"定远(兼第十将，去质孤堡一十五里。)","sentenceOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_318","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"龛谷(宋旧寨。)","sentenceOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_319","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"阿干(宋旧寨。)城二(宁远、安羌。)堡三(东关、质孤，临夏边，兼第八将。西关，临黄河、夏边)镇三(原川、猪觜、纳米。)关一(京玉。)","sentenceOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_320","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"巩州，下，节度。宋通远军，皇统二年升军事为通远军节度使。户三万六千三百一。县五、寨四、镇一：","sentenceOrder":320},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_321","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"陇西(宋旧县。)","sentenceOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_322","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"通渭","sentenceOrder":322},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_323","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"定西(贞祐四年六月升为州，以通西、安西隶焉。)镇一(盐川。旧有赤觜镇，后废。)","sentenceOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_324","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"通西","sentenceOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_325","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"安西寨四(熟羊，临宋界。来远，去宋界二十五里，旧为镇。永宁，去宋界三十里。南川。旧有平西、宁远二寨，及南三岔堡。)","sentenceOrder":325},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_326","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"会州，上，刺史。宋前旧名汝遮。户八千九百一十八。县一、(旧有会川城。)寨二关一：","sentenceOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_327","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"保川寨二(平西、通安。)关一(会安，旧作会宁。)","sentenceOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_328","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"河州，下，防御，宋安乡郡军事。至都西千七百一十里。皇统二年升军事为防御，贞祐四年十月升为节镇，军曰平西。户一万四千九百四十二。县二、城一、寨三、镇一：","sentenceOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_329","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"枹罕(国初废，贞元二年复置。)","sentenceOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_kim_su_26_330","chapterId":"ch_work_kim_su_26","textTraditional":"宁河城一(安乡关。)寨三(南川、通会关、定羌城。)镇一(积庆。)","sentenceOrder":330}],"overrides":{}}